        "note": {
          "en": "\\(P(t)=P_0e^{rt}\\). Same shape as Worked Example 6.3 (half-life) when \\(r&lt;0\\), and 6.4 (compound growth) when \\(r&gt;0\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Solving exponential and logarithmic equations",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p><strong>Exponential:</strong> (1) isolate base power; (2) apply \\(\\ln\\) both sides; (3) solve.</p><p><strong>Logarithmic:</strong> (1) combine using log properties; (2) exponentiate; (3) check domain.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> always verify solutions — \\(\\log\\) of a negative number is undefined.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 6.1 — Exponential equation",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Solve \\(5^{x+1}=3^{2x-1}\\). Give exact and decimal answers.",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>Take \\(\\ln\\): \\((x+1)\\ln5=(2x-1)\\ln3.\\)</p><p>\\(x\\ln5+\\ln5=2x\\ln3-\\ln3.\\quad x(\\ln5-2\\ln3)=-\\ln3-\\ln5.\\)</p><p>\\(x=\\dfrac{-\\ln3-\\ln5}{\\ln5-2\\ln3}=\\dfrac{-\\ln15}{\\ln5-\\ln9}=\\dfrac{\\ln15}{\\ln9-\\ln5}=\\dfrac{\\ln15}{\\ln(9/5)}\\approx\\dfrac{2.708}{0.588}\\approx4.61.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 6.2 — Logarithmic equation",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Solve \\(\\log(x+4)-\\log(x-1)=1.\\)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\(\\log\\!\\left(\\dfrac{x+4}{x-1}\\right)=1\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{x+4}{x-1}=10\\Rightarrow x+4=10x-10\\Rightarrow9x=14\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{14}{9}.\\)</p><p>Check: \\(x=14/9&gt;1\\) ✓, and \\(x+4&gt;0\\) ✓.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 6.3 — Half-life",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Strontium-90 has a half-life of 28.8 years. How long until only 15% of an initial sample remains?",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\(A(t)=A_0(0.5)^{t/28.8}.\\) Set \\(A=0.15\\,A_0:\\quad0.5^{t/28.8}=0.15.\\)</p><p>\\(\\dfrac{t}{28.8}\\ln0.5=\\ln0.15\\Rightarrow t=28.8\\cdot\\dfrac{\\ln0.15}{\\ln0.5}=28.8\\cdot\\dfrac{-1.897}{-0.693}\\approx78.8\\text{ years}.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 6.4 — Compound interest",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "\\$5000 is invested at 6% p.a. compounded monthly. Find the amount after 10 years, and compare with continuous compounding.",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>Monthly: \\(A=5000\\!\\left(1+\\dfrac{0.06}{12}\\right)^{120}=5000(1.005)^{120}\\approx5000(1.8194)\\approx\\$9097.\\)</p><p>Continuous: \\(A=5000\\,e^{0.06\\times10}=5000\\,e^{0.6}\\approx5000(1.8221)\\approx\\$9110.\\) Difference: \\$13 over 10 years.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
